# Frontend

- Server Components by default. Add `'use client'` only for state, events, or browser APIs (uploaders, proofing selectors, forms).
- Animate with `motion/react`. Do not add `framer-motion`. Shared easing is `EASE_LUXE` in `src/lib/motion.ts` and `--ease-luxe` in `src/app/globals.css`.
- Palette and type live in `src/app/globals.css` `@theme`: alabaster `#faf8f5`, linen `#f2eee8`, espresso `#2c2621`, ink `#171614`, stone `#6b665e`, hairline `#e5dfd6`, clay `#8c6a4a`, charcoal `#141413`. Serif is Cormorant (`font-serif`); sans is Plus Jakarta (`font-sans`). Page width is `container-page`; small caps labels use `eyebrow`.
